              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ālasyaṁ valla kaligina asaukaryāniki kṣamiñcaṇḍi.* — We are sorry for the inconvenience caused by the delay.]"
