          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వాకబు చేయు (vākabu cēyu) is a Telugu phrase: వాకబు, \"an enquiry\", whose origin is not settled, and the native చేయు, \"to do\" (DEDR 1957)."
